{"ts":"2026-07-25T20:48:30.637Z","caseId":"npm-nvm-node-clasp","caseIndex":0,"event":{"kind":"assistant_text","delta":"We need to answer the question: \"Как установить nvm, Node.js 20 и clasp, настроить глобальный prefix npm в домашнем каталоге и добавить его в PATH?\" The user asks for a step-by-step guide. The provided wiki pages include relevant information: nvm installation, Node.js 20 installation via nvm, clasp installation via npm, and npm global prefix configuration. We need to combine these into a coherent answer, using the exact commands from the pages, and linking to the relevant wiki pages. The answer should be in Russian, with code blocks in bash. We'll structure it as a step-by-step guide. We'll also note that the nfs and chromium/obsidian pages are irrelevant. We'll use the provided wiki links: [[wiki_os-unix_nvm]], [[wiki_os-unix_node]], [[wiki_os-unix_clasp]], [[wiki_os-unix_npm]]. We'll follow the formatting rules: fenced code blocks with language bash, no inline code for multi-word commands, etc. We'll provide a short answer at the start, then detailed steps. We'll mention that the steps are based on the wiki pages. We'll include the commands exactly as given. We'll also note that after installing nvm, you need to reload the shell. We'll combine the npm global prefix setup. We'll also mention that clasp is installed globally via npm. We'll ensure the PATH is set correctly. We'll output inRussian.","isReasoning":true}}
{"ts":"2026-07-25T20:48:30.637Z","caseId":"npm-nvm-node-clasp","caseIndex":0,"event":{"kind":"assistant_text","delta":"## Установка nvm, Node.js 20, clasp и настройка глобального префикса npm\n\nНиже приведена последовательность действий, основанная на страницах [[wiki_os-unix_nvm]], [[wiki_os-unix_node]], [[wiki_os-unix_clasp]] и [[wiki_os-unix_npm]].\n\n### 1. Установка nvm\nВыполните установку **Node Version Manager** и перезагрузите конфигурацию оболочки:\n\n```bash\ncurl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.0/install.sh | bash\nsource ~/.bashrc\n```\n\n### 2. Установка Node.js 20\nС помощью nvm установите и активируйте версию 20:\n\n```bash\nnvm install 20\nnvm use 20\n```\n\n### 3. Настройка глобального префикса npm в домашнем каталоге\nСоздайте каталог для глобальных пакетов, укажите его в качестве префикса и добавьте в `PATH`:\n\n```bash\nmkdir ~/.npm-global\nnpm config set prefix '~/.npm-global'\necho 'export PATH=~/.npm-global/bin:$PATH' >> ~/.bashrc\nsource ~/.bashrc\n```\n\n### 4. Установка clasp\nТеперь глобальная установка пакетов не требует прав root. Установите **clasp**:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g @google/clasp\n```\n\nПосле выполнения всех шагов утилита `clasp` будет доступна в командной строке, а глобальные npm-пакеты будут размещаться в `~/.npm-global`."}}
